silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_09_manifest_yoneda_profile_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '09ManifestyonedaprofileYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 09_manifest_yoneda_profile, the ] \\& |[classnode]| Cat/Felis\\ catus/TSN [d, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 09_manifest_yoneda_profile, the ] \\& [d, arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
